<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37551" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prae-dūrus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>very hard</i> (not in Cic. or Cæs.).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">faba praedura,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					18, 12, 30, § 121</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">radices,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					26, 8, 29, § 46</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">caput,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 9,
					29, 46, § 85</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">Quint. 11, 3, 69</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">corium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. H.
					1, 79</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dens,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					13, 66</span></i>
			 (al. perjurus).—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>very strong</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">homo praedurus viribus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 10, 748</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">corpora,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. G.
					2, 531</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tempora,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					M. 12, 349</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>very hard</i> or <i>difficult</i>, <i>very harsh</i>,
			etc.: aetas, i. e. <i>hardy</i> (opp. tenera), <i><span class="en">Col. 6, 2,
			1</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">labor,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Fl. 1, 235</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sunt quidam praeduri oris,</span>”
				i. e. <i>very impudent</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Quint. 6, 4, 11</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">verba,</span>”
				<i>very harsh</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					1, 6, 26</span></i>
			.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praedurē</span></b> , adv., <i>very hardy</i>, <i><span class="en">Avien. Pr. Mar.
			488</span></i>.</div>
